    "updated_at": "2017-04-18T03:01:19Z",
    "body": "I've been having second thoughts about this. But I really want to provide a stable target in the medium-term for browsers to implement. We could probably keep tweaking things forever if we let ourselves.\r\n\r\nIf/when browser vendors start complaining about this behaviour, that would be a good time to change it.",
